  "bodyText": "CL\n\nvancouver, BC >\n\nvancouver >\n\nhousing >\n\napartments / housing for rent\n\npost\naccount\nreply \nfavorite\n \nhide\n \n⚐\nflag\n \n\nshare\n\nPosted 14 days ago\n\nprint\n$5,000 / 2br - 979ft2 - Ocean View 2br/2ba with Den | Yorkville North (Kitsilano)\n1888 York Avenue, Vancouver, BC V6J5H8\n© craigslist - Map data © OpenStreetMap\n1888 York Avenue near Cypress Street\n\ngoogle map\n\n2BR / 2Ba 979ft2 available oct 1\nrent period: monthly\ncats are OK - purrr\napartment\ndogs are OK - wooof\nw/d in unit\noff-street parking\n2 Bedroom and Den for Rent in Kitsilano, Vancouver\nYorkville North at 1888 York Avenue is a property located in Vancouver’s sought-after Kitsilano neighbourhood, just minutes from Kitsilano Beach and the waterfront. This desirable Westside location offers convenient access to West 4th Avenue, Granville Island, Vanier Park and Downtown Vancouver, with shopping, dining, recreation and transit nearby.\n\nKitsilano Beach and the waterfront are just a short walk from the property, while nearby West 4th Avenue offers a wide selection of shops, cafés, restaurants and everyday conveniences. With beaches, parks, the Seawall and Granville Island all nearby, Yorkville North offers exceptional access to some of Vancouver’s most popular destinations.\n\nSUITE & BUILDING FEATURES\nSuites feature spacious floorplans, in-suite laundry, generous private decks and panoramic views of Burrard Inlet, the city and surrounding mountains. Secured underground parking is also available.\n\nCopy and paste for a Virtual Tour:\nhttps://my.matterport.com/show/?m=yDeRHakAAUN\n\nWALKABLE & CONNECTED LOCATION\nYorkville North offers an exceptionally walkable and bike-friendly Kitsilano location, with a Walk Score of 97 (Walker’s Paradise), Bike Score of 99 (Biker’s Paradise) and Transit Score of 72 (Excellent Transit). Shopping, dining, recreation, transit and some of Vancouver’s most popular destinations are all nearby.\n\nWalk Score 97 — Walker’s Paradise\nhttp://www.walkscore.com/score/1888-York-Avenue-Vancouver\n\nNearby amenities and destinations include:\n• Henry Hudson Elementary School (1 min walk)\n• Kitsilano Beach (7 min walk)\n• Kitsilano Pool (10 min walk)\n• West 4th Avenue shops, cafés & restaurants (10 min walk)\n• Whole Foods Market (10 min walk)\n• Vanier Park (12 min walk)\n• Hadden Park (15 min walk)\n• Museum of Vancouver (15 min walk)\n• H.R. MacMillan Space Centre (15 min walk)\n• Granville Island (15 min walk)\n• Downtown Vancouver (10 min drive / 10 min bike)\n\nImages and virtual tours may depict a similar floor plan and may be virtually staged. Actual suite finishes, features and layouts may vary.\n\n\npost id: 7964413899\n\n \n\nposted: 14 days ago\n\n \n\nupdated: 42 minutes ago\n\n \n\n♥ best of [?]\n\nhelp\nsafety\nprivacy\nterms\nabout\napp\n© 2026 craigslist",
